# Determinism is a requirement in this repo, not a nicety: artefacts and
# generated forms are byte-reproducible for a fixed seed, and two clean runs
# are compared by sha256.  `core.autocrlf` on a Windows checkout would rewrite
# every line ending and break that comparison for a reason unrelated to the
# pipeline.  LF is pinned here for the same reason `engine-rig/.gitattributes`
# pins it there.
* text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.dsl   text eol=lf
*.pddl  text eol=lf
*.lean  text eol=lf
